== Effects ==
* Opens all doors in the room.
* Creates a {{r|Red Room}} on all valid walls of the room. This is indicated by walls that have red door outlines on them.

== Notes ==
* '''Soul of Cain''' can destroy the mirror located in {{s|Downpour}} / {{s|Dross}} II.
* '''Soul of Cain''' can open:
:# Any normal doors that are closed during combat, even on floors that normally disallow this;
:# Any dоor requiring {{e|Key}}s;
:# Any door requiring {{e|Bomb}}s to blow open (including {{r|Secret Room}} and {{r|Super Secret Room}} doors);
:# {{r|Challenge Room}} and {{r|Boss Challenge Room}} doors regardless of health total;
:# The door to the {{e|Mega Satan}} arena;
:# The {{r|Boss Rush}} door from inside;
:# The doors of a {{r|Mini-Boss Room}} from inside;
:# Most {{r|Boss Room}} dоors from inside;
:# The exit door in {{mode|greed}} [[Greed mode]];
:#* Leaving the main room before clearing a set of waves will reset the wave counter, and repeated waves will not drop coins or charge Isaac's activated item.
:# The {{s|Mausoleum}} / {{s|Gehenna}} doors without paying the health cost;
:# The flesh door leading to {{s|Corpse}};
:# {{a|A Strange Door}}.
:# The closet containing a tainted character in {{s|Home}}.

* '''Soul of Cain''' cannot open:
:# The {{r|Boss Rush}} door if the timer has already passed 20 minutes;
:# The door to the room leading to {{s|???}} if the timer has already passed 30 minutes;
:# {{r|Angel Room}} or {{r|Devil Room}} doors from the outside;
:# The door of {{E|Mom}}'s Boss Room from inside;
:# The door to {{s|The Void}} during the {{e|Hush}} boss fight.

== Strategy ==
* '''Soul of Cain''' can serve as a {{r|Secret Room}} finder, as secret room entrances do not have red door outlines.
* Refer to the {{r|Ultra Secret Room}} page for the strategy to better find it.

